    "body": "I think we've found this is not web-compatible when it's been tried in the past. Too much code does things like conditional polyfilling, or assuming that if `map` *does not* exist then it must be a NodeList that needs to be wrapped in an Array or similar.\r\n\r\nI doubt implementations will be excited to try this, to save people from typing `.entries()`.",
